 says \"(excl. territories)\". Territories typically include Puerto Rico, US Virgin Islands, Guam, American Samoa, Northern Mariana Islands, etc. From the farmers markets data, I can see Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands. I should exclude those.\n\nHowever, there's another interpretation: the \"United States\" row in the census file might already be the total for all states excluding territories. Let me check the census file first.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Let me check the census population file to find the United States row:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01P8cbNmPVWuQ8gPpYCE6Mc5","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"census_population","compose":"source.filter(source.NAME == 'United States').select('NAME', 'POPESTIMATE2025')"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":420,"cacheRead":18706,"cacheWrite":418,"totalTokens":19557,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.0021000000000000003,"cacheRead":0.0018706000000000003,"cacheWrite":0.0005225,"total":0.004506100000000001},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":279},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912997517,"responseId":"msg_011Ce75UyiHMswk42a9mn7nz","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01P8cbNmPVWuQ8gPpYCE6Mc5","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"NAME\",\"POPESTIMATE2025\"\n\"United States\",341784857\n\n(showing up to 50 rows; pass limit or aggregate to count — do not page)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913004190},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! I found the US population for 2025: 341,784,857.\n\nNow, I need to:\n1. Sum the farmers markets from the farmers_markets table, excluding territories (Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands)\n2. Create a metric to calculate farmers markets per 100,000 residents\n\nLet me first calculate the total farmers markets (excluding territories).","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me calculate the total farmers markets (excluding territories):"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_011HTNF8bsxeqLgdJ5nz4Wh8","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.filter(source.state_name != 'Puerto Rico').filter(source.state_name != 'Virgin Islands').aggregate(total_markets=source.farmers_markets.sum())"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":239,"cacheRead":19124,"cacheWrite":477,"totalTokens":19852,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.001195,"cacheRead":0.0019124,"cacheWrite":0.00059625,"total":0.0037156500000000005},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":85},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786913004190,"responseId":"msg_011Ce75VSc3MvZZu6H2y7zCT","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_011HTNF8bsxeqLgdJ5nz4Wh8","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"total_markets\"\n7942\n\n(showing up to 50 rows; pass limit or aggregate to count — do not page)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913007793},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! So the total farmers markets (excluding territories) is 7,942.\n\nNow I need to create a metric that calculates:\nfarmers_markets_per_100k = (7942 / 341784857) * 100000\n\nLet me compute this by creating a derived metric. I'll create a build script that joins the two sources and computes the metric.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create a derived metric. Let me write a build script to join both sources and compute the per-capita rate:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01QEiBdfFJd4PP52skbdAqRp","name":"write","arguments":{"path":".xorq/scripts/build_farmers_markets_per_capita.py","content":"import urllib.request as u\n_o = u.build_opener()\n_o.addheaders = [(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0\")]\nu.install_opener(_o)\n\nfrom xorq.vendor.ibis.common.collections import FrozenDict\nimport xorq.api as xo\n\nso = FrozenDict({\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\ncon = xo.pandas.connect()\n\n# Read farmers markets data\nfact = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"farmers_markets\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Read census population data\nref = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"census_population\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Calculate total farmers markets excluding territories\nfact_total = (\n    fact.filter(fact.state_name != 'Puerto Rico')\n        .filter(fact.state_name != 'Virgin Islands')\n        .aggregate(total_markets=fact.farmers_markets.sum())\n        .mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n)\n\n# Get US population from census\nref_us = (\n    ref.filter(ref.NAME == 'United States')\n        .select('POPESTIMATE2025')\n        .mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n)\n\n# Join and calculate the metric\nexpr = (\n    fact_total.join(ref_us, fact_total.k == ref_us.k)\n        .mutate(markets_per_100k=fact_total.total_markets / ref_us.POPESTIMATE2025 * 100000)\n        .select('total_markets', 'POPESTIMATE2025', 'markets_per_100k')\n)\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":713,"cacheRead":19601,"cacheWrite":285,"totalTokens":20611,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.0035650000000000005,"cacheRead":0.0019601,"cacheWrite":0.00035625,"total":0.00589335},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":87},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786913007793,"responseId":"msg_011Ce75Vhra1mWkebob6VJ9P","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01QEiBdfFJd4PP52skbdAqRp","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 1416 bytes to .xorq/scripts/build_farmers_markets_per_capita.py"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913014562},{"role":"assistant","con